<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:31:06Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>After floods, Nepal minister demands 'climate justice'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:705a681cfae3c16d4700eb3e77d00ea759e8563e7d6ad540dae92362dcf7b1ec</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T12:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/after-floods-nepal-minister-demands-climate-justice/a-79372239--033ba1d032f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/after-floods-nepal-minister-demands-climate-justice/a-79372239?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With Nepal still reeling from the devastating floods in August, Kathmandu is calling for climate justice and seeking compensation from the UN-backed Loss and Damage Fund, Environment Minister Geeta Chaudhary told DW.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Could we see MMA at the Olympics?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:303bbd369b9360f1b69ca2845ed44836020b1c5bb3b9df29be429bb5209dde79</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:27Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T12:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/could-we-see-mma-at-the-olympics/a-79369605--f76e8af14c92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/could-we-see-mma-at-the-olympics/a-79369605?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Mixed martial arts has made its debut at the Asian Games this week. It takes the sport closer to the Olympics but there are doubts about the next step, and the influence of the popular and lucrative UFC.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Iran war spreads through region as Trump seeks way out</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e4ba1320d2abe032d9b18735ff752ccb2e7f4c854b5c927b2cb5f3a8e25cad8</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T11:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-war-spreads-through-region-as-trump-seeks-way-out/a-79370506--a1fa6d225e80.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-spreads-through-region-as-trump-seeks-way-out/a-79370506?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Washington, Tehran and the Gulf states continue to pursue different objectives while searching for a way to end the Iran war.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Turkey: Several pupils injured in shooting outside school</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:232b643e31f4d82cee62ec8beeb32b0d5f45ec71f58efc2401d3d2d7a543f783</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/turkey-several-pupils-injured-in-shooting-outside-school/a-79368728--cc52dff21bd4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-several-pupils-injured-in-shooting-outside-school/a-79368728?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The shooter, a pupil, allegedly took a rifle and shot indiscriminately at his schoolmates in front of their high school. Turkey was shocked by two back-to-back school shootings earlier this year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia, Ukraine trade deadly strikes as Zelenskyy attends UNGA</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3baaeb17eca1bd028b9674624ac44e0965108aae4d34154127896885605f11e4</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:36Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-trade-deadly-strikes-as-zelenskyy-attends-unga/a-79366022--933d7c07ec6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-trade-deadly-strikes-as-zelenskyy-attends-unga/a-79366022?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Russian army targeted economic infrastructure in Ukraine, while Ukraine struck an oil refinery. This comes ahead of the UN General Assembly, where President Volodymyr Zelenskyy is due to meet Trump on the sidelines.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Male infertility is 'grossly underreported'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d56cbd4f26d7467b8389c3199ff23c9c692baeb3c60c0e7b14b7a7274ebe19d1</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:39Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722--14a06576edd4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">It's not all on women anymore — doctors do test men for sperm count and motility. But still too few men get checked, possibly due to a misconception that a healthy sex life means healthy sperm. Spoiler: It doesn't.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>UNGA: Leaders gather as General Assembly kicks off</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:690c4ee7aeac6543fda1e279a792f8fd5acaaaa9f6155b1d78fa581e511c2ab1</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T08:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/unga-leaders-gather-as-general-assembly-kicks-off/live-79366211--3caa0ec483b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/unga-leaders-gather-as-general-assembly-kicks-off/live-79366211?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">World leaders have begun gathering in New York for the UN General Assembly. US President Trump will address the body on Tuesday, as will his Finnish, French and Turkish counterparts. Follow DW for the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Swan Song': New book by Princess Diana's brother drops</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0c55fb538c3cf509e60db0775112a92fc262bca232d9ce368eccfad48e8cc2f</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:46Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T08:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/swan-song-new-book-by-princess-diana-s-brother-drops/a-79365835--93fce9a8a45c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/swan-song-new-book-by-princess-diana-s-brother-drops/a-79365835?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A memoir penned by Charles Spencer on his older sister's life has been released, opening old royal wounds nearly three decades after Princess Diana's death.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Will Germany have enough gas this winter amid energy supply crunch?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fda04f10c823f73fb5f61cc629975e68048f4163a7f0f2a933e47724410a0217</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T08:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-germany-have-enough-gas-this-winter-amid-energy-supply-crunch/a-79360317--cfd94c55c93d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-germany-have-enough-gas-this-winter-amid-energy-supply-crunch/a-79360317?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's gas storage sites are far less full than in recent years. Officials say supplies are secure, but analysts warn that a cold winter or import disruptions could push prices higher. So how secure is the supply?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: VW to step up cost-cutting program</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:059d8aa1b103dd0fd2da1d31fa8221c1f7db48b22fffb00185bbf90bbd8682c7</id><updated>2026-09-22T13:30:51Z</update